{
  "_comment": "One object per data row of SPEC.md § 19 — sixteen when T15 appends the wave-3 hook row. `kind` discriminates: `hook` is an (event, matcher, command) triple asserted in BOTH settings files (R151); `statusline` is not a triple and has its own shape; `path` resolves on disk. `lands` marks a row whose deliverable ships later in this release — honoured only under --allow-pending, and only until the file exists.",
